Z||000009||Oreif||06-16-2001||02:53 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by cadaver:<BR><B>But how did you know how long it was. You were an inch off.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I said "calculated" because from the photo it looks to be 2" below the dash. The dash from the bottom of the dash speaker to the bottom edge is roughly 6". It was a guess from the pic. No flaming was ment by it. I was just stating the internal volume for those that would  like to correcly match a woofer to the volume you have. But since you gave the correct length, it is .216 cubic feet.(speaker displacement of .08 already subtracted)<P>I don't know how stating the internal volume has somehow caused you to think I am "negative" about your box. There are a few 8" woofers that can work fine in that size box. <BR>||||reg||1
